ints/main/model_022003k.pt","score":"","champion":"checkpoints/main/model_022003k.pt","run":"main","replay":"replays/main_0046.gif"},{"t":"2026-11-09 01:16:36","title":"Pre-registered: how the final result will be judged","text":"Written at 20.5 M frames, before any final results exist. (1) Candidates: the final 40 M checkpoint and the best two checkpoints by the 10-game checks from 30 M frames on. (2) For each candidate, a 100-game evaluation on fresh seeds (900000-900099), strict full-game protocol, gives its true level; the candidate with the highest 100-game mean is THE model. (3) The goal check for THE model is 10 full games on seeds 12345-12354 (the fixed check seeds), strict full-game protocol; it is reported together with its 100-game mean, so a lucky 10-game draw can't pass silently. The training-wrapper protocol is reported alongside. (4) If THE model's 100-game mean is below 300, training continues from the 40 M checkpoint as change 3 (a short extra schedule), as long as the deadline allows, and every result is reported. Context for these rules: at 20 M frames the 10-game check said 229.7, but 64 envpool games said 169.5 (standard error 17), and 16 gymnasium games 132.4 (standard error 26.5): consistent with each other within the noise, and far noisier than one 10-game check suggests.","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-11-09 01:16:16","kind":"checkpoint","frames":21504000,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_021504k.pt","score":172.0,"run":"main"},{"t":"2026-11-09 01:08:11","kind":"checkpoint","frames":21000192,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_021000k.pt","score":343.5,"run":"main"},{"t":"2026-11-09 01:01:04","kind":"checkpoint","frames":20500480,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_020500k.pt","score":"","run":"main"},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-09 00:53:52","policy":"checkpoints/main/model_020000k.pt","frames":20000768,"n":10,"score":185.7,"std":136.76098371489826,"ci":[87.87388274923715,283.5261172507628],"min":46.0,"max":404.0,"scores":[63.0,239.0,216.0,309.0,70.0